    A post header with the author, the reading figures, the tags and the actions. Axes: layout (center: tags, figures and an author card with share and save over a wide cover; split: beside the cover; outline: facts and related reading beside the cover), mediaSide, author (line, card, bio), cover (wide, square), actions (pair, wide, icons), tone.
    Props (p): id, post, labels, extras, level, layout, mediaSide, author, cover, actions, tone, landmarkLabel. -#}
